---
// Quiz figure (post 20, Alpha): shows only the scenario's inputs, no answer. Inline SVG, site tokens only.
---
<div class="qfig-atq20band">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 560 160" role="img" aria-label="A price line from 90,000 to 110,000 VND with a gold band from the floor 93,000 to the ceiling 107,000 around the reference price 100,000.">
<text x="0" y="20" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>HOSE daily band: reference price 100,000 VND</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Biên độ ngày HOSE: giá tham chiếu 100.000 đồng</tspan></text>
<line x1="30" y1="80" x2="530" y2="80" class="ax" />
<rect x="105" y="64" width="350" height="32" rx="4" class="okb" />
<line x1="105" y1="60" x2="105" y2="100" class="st" />
<text x="105.0" y="122" class="s" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>floor 93,000</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>sàn 93.000</tspan></text>
<line x1="280" y1="60" x2="280" y2="100" class="st" />
<text x="280.0" y="122" class="s" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>reference 100,000</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tham chiếu 100.000</tspan></text>
<line x1="455" y1="60" x2="455" y2="100" class="st" />
<text x="455.0" y="122" class="s" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>ceiling 107,000</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trần 107.000</tspan></text>
<text x="30" y="150" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>Prices outside the gold band cannot trade that day.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mức giá ngoài dải vàng không giao dịch được trong ngày.</tspan></text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-atq20band { margin: 0.5em 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-atq20band svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .qfig-atq20band text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-atq20band .h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-atq20band .s { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-atq20band .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-atq20band .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .qfig-atq20band .okb { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .qfig-atq20band .badb { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .qfig-atq20band .ax { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; fill: none; }
  .qfig-atq20band .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 3 4; fill: none; }
  .qfig-atq20band .mut { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; fill: none; }
  .qfig-atq20band .st { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .qfig-atq20band .gd { fill: var(--gold); } .qfig-atq20band .rd { fill: var(--red); }
</style>